message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below. A
  journal publication describing the GSF 2025/2026 model is in preparation;
  until it appears, please cite the original GSF paper (Dembinski et al.,
  ICRC 2017, PoS(ICRC2017)533, arXiv:1711.11432) alongside this software.
